Package: devjam-gpu-intel-config
Version: 1.1-1
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Optimizations for the i915 Intel driver
 modprobe options for the i915 driver that enable GuC/HuC firmware
 loading, frame buffer compression, atomic (nuclear) page flips and
 DMC wakelock.
